ased drawing board inside agent chat. It is for the moments where a screenshot, rough diagram, annotated idea, or hand-drawn layout says more than a paragraph."},"178":{"id":"/docs/features/draw-9","page_id":"/docs/features/draw","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/draw","content":"You can draw, paste images, drop image files, reopen previous drawings, export the board, or send the whole drawing to the agent as a single PNG attachment."},"179":{"id":"/docs/features/draw-10","page_id":"/docs/features/draw","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/draw#what-draw-is-good-for","content":"Annotating screenshots before asking an agent to fix a UI"},"180":{"id":"/docs/features/draw-11","page_id":"/docs/features/draw","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/draw#what-draw-is-good-for","content":"Sketching a screen layout or state machine"},"181":{"id":"/docs/features/draw-12","page_id":"/docs/features/draw","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/draw#what-draw-is-good-for","content":"Drawing arrows over an error, trace, or design reference"},"182":{"id":"/docs/features/draw-13","page_id":"/docs/features/draw","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/draw#what-draw-is-good-for","content":"Combining pasted images with hand-written notes"},"183":{"id":"/docs/features/draw-14","page_id":"/docs/features/draw","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/draw#what-draw-is-good-for","content":"Sending one compact visual brief instead of many separate files"},"184":{"id":"/docs/features/draw-15","page_id":"/docs/features/draw","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/draw#opening-draw","content":"In agent chat, use the drawing control in the composer. Gent opens a full drawing modal with an Excalidraw canvas and a small toolbar."},"185":{"id":"/docs/features/draw-16","page_id":"/docs/features/draw","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/draw#opening-draw","content":"The toolbar includes:"},"186":{"id":"/docs/features/draw-17","page_id":